 flank?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l017","ordinal":384188,"en":"Our mighty wrestler Akjoltoy—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l018","ordinal":384189,"en":"Father, by God’s decree,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l019","ordinal":384190,"en":"Must he die at an infidel’s hands?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l020","ordinal":384191,"en":"Must he take the road of no return?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l021","ordinal":384192,"en":"Must a golden life, dearer than the world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l022","ordinal":384193,"en":"Be snuffed out by a firebrand?”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l023","ordinal":384194,"en":"Biting their thumbs and shaking their heads,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l024","ordinal":384195,"en":"They all spoke of the dreadful news:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l025","ordinal":384196,"en":"“Alas, what can I do with this grief?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l026","ordinal":384197,"en":"Oh, this loneliness!” they cried."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l027","ordinal":384198,"en":"“Have I met these raiders"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l028","ordinal":384199,"en":"Only to meet my death upon the ridge?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l029","ordinal":384200,"en":"Will these fortunate Chinese"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l030","ordinal":384201,"en":"Settle freely upon Jonok?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l031","ordinal":384202,"en":"With blood drained and senses reeling,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l032","ordinal":384203,"en":"When every means is exhausted,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l033","ordinal":384204,"en":"There is no kinsman,” he said faintly."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l034","ordinal":384205,"en":"As Joltoy stood in this plight,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l035","ordinal":384206,"en":"Brave Seytek, the hero’s son,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l036","ordinal":384207,"en":"Could scarcely rein Kulansur’s mouth:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l037","ordinal":384208,"en":"“God, preserve him!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l038","ordinal":384209,"en":"Where is Joltoy, my joy?” he cried."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l039","ordinal":384210,"en":"The gray-maned hero could not remain still."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b002:l040","ordinal":384211,"en":"Clad in his splendid golden coat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l001","ordinal":384212,"en":"Mounted on his sleek, water-smooth steed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l002","ordinal":384213,"en":"He traveled day and night,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l003","ordinal":384214,"en":"Exhausting his horse as he searched the land,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l004","ordinal":384215,"en":"Seizing his spear in wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l005","ordinal":384216,"en":"Setting his firearm ready,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l006","ordinal":384217,"en":"Scanning the passes and searching the ground,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l007","ordinal":384218,"en":"Driving the sweat from his horse’s coat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l008","ordinal":384219,"en":"He followed the trail where the two giants,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l009","ordinal":384220,"en":"Akjoltoy and Bilgich, had given chase."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l010","ordinal":384221,"en":"Growling and gathering fury,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l011","ordinal":384222,"en":"Taking on the aspect of a hungry lion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l012","ordinal":384223,"en":"His majesty swelling into rage,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l013","ordinal":384224,"en":"He resolved to ride as far as Kakan,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l014","ordinal":384225,"en":"To discover whether Joltoy"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l015","ordinal":384226,"en":"Was dead or alive."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l016","ordinal":384227,"en":"He aimed the wretched steed"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l017","ordinal":384228,"en":"Along the very road of the chase:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l018","ordinal":384229,"en":"“If Akjoltoy, whom I seek,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l019","ordinal":384230,"en":"Has not died but still lives,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l020","ordinal":384231,"en":"May I stir up a mighty conflict behind me"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l021","ordinal":384232,"en":"And win myself renown."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l022","ordinal":384233,"en":"That bravest hero, worthy of the name,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l023","ordinal":384234,"en":"That peerless falcon,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l024","ordinal":384235,"en":"Was accomplished, a true man;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l025","ordinal":384236,"en":"His valor was unsurpassed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l026","ordinal":384237,"en":"It seems he went forth, sparing not his life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l027","ordinal":384238,"en":"Chasing after the cunning Bilgich;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l028","ordinal":384239,"en":"Ill-fated Akjoltoy"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l029","ordinal":384240,"en":"Seems to have gone as far as Kakan."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l030","ordinal":384241,"en":"He was a kinsman who gave us shelter,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l031","ordinal":384242,"en":"A man untouched by sorrow,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l032","ordinal":384243,"en":"The bulwark of our dear people here."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l033","ordinal":384244,"en":"If enemies came from right and left,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l034","ordinal":384245,"en":"If challengers encircled him tenfold,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l035","ordinal":384246,"en":"In the crush of clashing battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l036","ordinal":384247,"en":"Where blood was spilled,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l037","ordinal":384248,"en":"His presence always shielded us."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l038","ordinal":384249,"en":"Almighty God who created living souls,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l039","ordinal":384250,"en":"May God preserve Joltoy!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1137:b004:l040","ordinal":384251,"en":"Joltoy was the very eye of fortune,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1138:b002:l001","ordinal":384252,"en":"The true source of prosperity,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1138:b002:l002","ordinal":384253,"en":"The root of all abundance."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1138:b002:l003","ordinal":384254,"en":"He was a hero who never grieved,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1138:b002:l004","ordinal":384255,"en":"One of the fierce black-maned wolves."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1138:b002:l005","ordinal":384256,"en":"May God preserve Joltoy!"}]
